  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 760198,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1942 for Nintendo Wii: Relive a Classic Arcade Shooter\n\nExperience the thrill of Capcom’s iconic 1984 arcade hit, *1942*, now available on the Wii Virtual Console! Step into the cockpit of an American P-38 fighter plane and embark on a perilous mission through the Pacific Theater of World War II. Loosely based on the pivotal Battle of Midway, your objective is to reach Tokyo and dismantle the Japanese air fleet – a bold move reflecting the game’s pioneering design for Western audiences.\n\nThis vertically scrolling shooter delivers fast-paced, addictive gameplay. Blast through waves of enemy aircraft, dodging their fire and collecting power-ups to enhance your firepower. Master the \"loop-the-loop\" maneuver to evade danger and, occasionally, benefit from a \"Tip Tow\" formation where you're escorted by smaller fighter planes. \n\n*1942* is a true arcade classic, renowned for its challenging difficulty and engaging gameplay. Now, bring the nostalgia home and test your skills against the Japanese air force on your Wii!"
    },
